OL,3,AMan and woman in their late teens die
OL,4,Ain collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people in their late teens died in
OL,7,Fa collision involving two cars, Suffolk
OL,8,FPolice said.
OL,10,FOfficers were first called by the
OL,11,Fambulance service to Debenham Road near
OL,12,FLittle Stonham at 10:15 BST.
OL,14,FFire crews and the air ambulance were
OL,15,Falso called to the incident that
OL,16,Finvolved a red Peugeot 107 and a silver
OL,17,FVolkswagen Passat.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
