OL,3,AMan and woman in their late teens die
OL,4,Ain collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said a male passenger in the
OL,7,FPeugeot died at the scene. The female
OL,8,Fdriver was taken to Addenbrooke's
OL,9,FHospital in Cambridge by land
OL,10,Fambulance, but has since died as a
OL,11,Fresult of her injuries.
